 ## Goal
 
@@ -21,11 +21,21 @@ Build a standalone local web dashboard in this workspace that reads `~/.codex` u
 11. Extend the dashboard with OpenClaw ChatGPT/Codex usage sourced from CodexBar local cost output. Completed.
